window.products.push({"id":239184,"name":"BOSKA Soft Cheese Knife, Mini, Rose Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21A9fIuZrjL._AC_.jpg","description":"Brie Knife TasteYou think cutting soft cheese is a sticky affair? Not anymore. This knife will let you cut through the softest, stickiest cheeses with the ultimate ease due to its long, narrow blade. The dark, wooden handle gives this cheese knife a classic and authentic look that you just can’t resist.-NO STICKING: The narrow blade has less surface area for cheese to stick to-IDEAL FOR: Soft (and sticky) cheeses such as Brie, Camembert, and Talleggio-EUROPEAN DESIGN: Authentic dark wood handle & stainless steel bladeDifferent knives for each cheese?Every cheese deserves its own knife, because cheese varies so much in its properties and structure. With the right knife, it only gets easier, and the cheese experience gets even better. Take, for example, this Brie Knife. The narrow blade has less surface area, so the cheese has less “knife” to stick to. This means you’ll slice through soft and sticky cheeses much more smoothly and easily.MaintenanceThis knife is hand wash only. The wooden handle is not dishwasher safe. The blade also stays sharper when hand washed, leading to better cutting performance. A monthly rub of mineral oil will keep the wood looking great.10 Year GuaranteeBoska Holland works hard to procure materials of the highest quality and produce its products through expert manufacturing. We’re proud of our cheese tools and believe they will stand the test of time, so we offer you a 10 year guarantee on this product.About Boska Holland Cheese waresWe love cheese! Since 1896, here at Boska, it’s been our mission to spread the love of cheese to everyone everywhere. Our innovative family-owned company started as a blacksmith making tools for the cheese farmers in Holland, and now we are the world’s only specialist in Cheese wares: cheese tools and accessories. In short: we sell everything you need to enjoy cheese except the cheese itself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21A9fIuZrjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B075D2JDGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075D2JDGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075D2JDGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
