window.products.push({"id":239195,"name":"Porcelain Plates – BonCeram 11 Inch Kitchen Ceramic Plate for Pasta, Meals, Dessert, Salad - Round Everyday Dishes - Set of 6 in Assorted Pure Color, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QyHQrzEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The right ceramics has a profound impact on how you enjoy a life, therefore, “ BonCeram ” means “ good ceramics ” to express our enthusiasm for everyday life. We are working with traditional craftsmanship, materials and techniques to create functional and affordable ceramics. Each piece of Bonceram is unique and special. √ Functional Size - Not too small, Not too big. There are easily come in handy for soup, cereal, salads, ice cream, and even as serving pieces for side dishes. √ Sturdy and Durable - Bonceram ceramics are made of high-quality porcelain. It can safely go in the microwave, oven,freezer, and dishwasher as well. And there are took up less space in your cupboard. √ Aesthetic Appeal – As one of the focal points besides the meal, It’s, therefore, Bonceram ceramics assorted stylish,chic and attractive pieces in one set. It is suitable for everyday use, casual and formal setting whether at home, vacation home, restaurant and other places. USE&CARE ▪ When ceramic products are fired at high temperatures, there will be tiny black spots, pinholes, uneven glaze, etc., all of which do not affect the use. ▪ Scraping of sharp objects such as metals can cause scratches on ceramics. If the ceramics have been scratched, you can use soda or vinegar to add warm water to soak, or use toothpaste to polish. ▪ Please do not use metal wire balls to clean.The correct cleaning method can increase the service life of ceramic products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QyHQrzEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonceram","source_asin":"B07W1KSPQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W1KSPQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W1KSPQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
