window.products.push({"id":239202,"name":"Pawque Sherpa Fleece Weighted Blanket 15lbs Twin Size 48 x 72 Inches, Super Soft Cozy Hug Weighted Blanket for Adults, Fuzzy Fluffy Sherpa Flannel Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HeulUZoJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Utmost Comfort : These excellent Sherpa fleece weighted blankets feature 220GSM Sherpa top and 220GSM flannel reverse with layered textures to offer on-clouds fluffy sensations and maximized softness and warmth. Wrap it around your body in Air conditioning summer nights or cold winter to obtain optimal coziness. Sherpa fleece won’t shed, wrinkle, or pill even after long use and will be fresh as new after washes Enjoy a Tighter Sleep: Pawque weighted blankets with even weight distribution promote deep sleep so you won’t fall out of sleep during the night, waking up revitalized in the morning. They are ideal for uses in the bedroom, living room, couch, office, camping van, or on travels, making a perfect gift for father’s day, mother’s day, valentine, Christmas, wedding or birthday Impeccable Craftsmanship and Design: Upgraded 7 layer structure and sophisticated sewing seamlessly press the ceramic beads right in the middle layer, reducing shuffles and noises and creating an absolutely tranquil sleep environment. Special made beads are evenly distributed in each grid. Unique tight stitches with as minor as 0.3mm spacing prevent beads shifting to offer balanced weight dispersion Ideal Size: Choose a blanket appropriate to your body weight at around 8% - 15%. 12lbs are suitable for people of 100 - 130lbs, 15lbs for people of 110 - 180lbs, 20lbs for people more than 180lbs. Best to use this blanket on an individual. For first uses, start with a lighter one. It may take 2 - 7 days to get used to it. Please note that weighted blankets are designed smaller and heavier than regular ones so they can better focus the weight on your body and will not hang on the edge of the bed. Customer Care and Washing Tips: Pawque make the biggest effort to offer the best quality products and services. All products are granted with 30 day refund and life warranty. If you have any questions or suggestions, we will do our best to resolve to your fullest satisfaction. Wash Instructions: wash the 12lbs blankets with household washer; spot clean or use a commercial washer to wash 15lbs and 20lbs ones with cold water","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HeulUZoJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pawque","source_asin":"B09D37DWFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D37DWFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D37DWFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
