window.products.push({"id":239235,"name":"Kimfeng Handmade Damascus Chef Knife 67-layer Damascus Kitchen Knife Professional VG10 Stainless Steel Cooking Cleaver Ergonomic Black Handle 8 Inch C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yV99BhgXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kimfeng Corrosion Resistant Damascus Chef Knife Are Put Through A Series of 8 Engineering Processes and Are Hand-Finished with Our V-Shape Sharpening Technology,Which Means You Can Cut Through Vegetables,Fruit,Meat or Tender and Juicy Roast.Make Your Life and Cooking Joyful.Mirror Polish Chefs Knife Blade:Chefs Knife's Surface Is Hand Polished to Mirror Finish at 15 Degrees Per Side for Less Cutting Friction and Better Sharpness as well as Anti-Rust Ability,Making Chef Knife Easier to Clean and Keep Gloss for A Long Time.VG 10 Damascus Steel Cladding:Chef's Knife Is Made from Professional 67-Layer VG-10 Damascus High-Carbon Stainless Steel Ensures Exceptional Strength,VG 10 Cutting Core at 60-62 Rockwell Hardness,Which Ensures The Chef's Knives with Super High Durability While Providing Super Sharpness.High Quality Material Gives Knife An Extremely Long Life.Ergonomic Color Wood Handle:The Ergonomic Handle Is Made from Solid Wood for Comfort and Durability,and The Tapered Handle Features Hand Polished Textured and Stainless Steel Edge Cladding Provide Slip Resistance and A Better Grip.Each Handle Is Engineered to Gently Widen Where It Meets The Blade to Help Protect Fingers.Warm Tips:The 8-Inch Chef Knife with High Density Color Wood Inlay Handle Is Sanitary yet Environmentally Friendly.Due to The Different Cutting Season and Growth Environment,There Are Certain Differences in The Color and Texture of The Handle.Thank You Very Much for Your Understanding.MaintenanceDo Not Cut Bones or Hard Food (Bones,Dried Food,Frozen Food,Shelled Nut etc.)Wash By Hand and Dry with A Soft Cloth Immediately After Use.When The Knife Falls,Please Don't Catch The Knife By HandsDo Not Use Your Hand to Test The Hardness of The Blade.Please Store in A Place Where Children Cannot Reach It.Please Don't Put The Chef Knife in The Dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yV99BhgXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kimfeng","source_asin":"B0BGQJC1H2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGQJC1H2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGQJC1H2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
