window.products.push({"id":239425,"name":"· REDEARTH · Cube Pouf Foot Stool Ottoman - Hand Knitted Coffee Table - Cotton Cord Boho Pouffe - Home Décor Poof - Stuffed Footrest for Living Room -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1-5iH4GFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHERE STYLE EFFORTLESSLY BLENDS WITH FUNCTION: Our handcrafted cube knitted pouf/ottoman foot rest is a beautiful accent piece for your home or business. It complements any kind of interior décor and is perfect for creating extra seating or for using as a footrest . Put one on display in the living room, bedroom, playroom, kid’s room, nursery, or any other room in and around your home. Give a Comfortable feeling to hardwood floors with our Hand Knitted Cotton Pouffe Ottoman. HANDMADE FROM THE FINEST MATERIALS: The outer material on this eye-catching pouf ottoman is made from 100% cotton chord knitted in a unique pattern and filled with thermocol block inserts. Each floor pouf measures 16x16x16 inches and is handmade by our talented in-house artisans. This floor pouf is perfect when you need to rest your leg NUMEROUS COLOR OPTIONS TO SUITS YOUR NEEDS: These poof ottomans come in a wide variety of colors for your convenience. Choose from n-number of color options of poufs whichever goes best with your interior. This large pouf ottoman can turn any room into an exciting, dynamic space that brings the party to your living room.Each pouf is as stunning as the last. DESIGNED TO BE VERY LOW MAINTENANCE: These pouffe ottomans are very easy to care for. We recommend that you vacuum them regularly and wipe spills immediately with a dry cloth. Use a soft cloth dipped in warm water and mild detergent for cleaning stains. This will assist prevent the stain from penetrating deeper into the fabric of your pouffe. MAKES A LOVELY, THOUGHTFUL GIFT IDEA: Our knit braided cord ottoman pouf/accent Footstool is a gift that will keep on giving for many years to come. Surprise a friend or family member with one for a housewarming party, birthday, holiday, and any other special occassions. Choose from a wide range of colours to suit your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1-5iH4GFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDEARTH","source_asin":"B0962M3564","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0962M3564","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0962M3564","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
