window.products.push({"id":239468,"name":"Professional On the Go blender for shakes and smoothie. Our blender for shakes and smoothies is stainless Steel with Multi Function. Ideal mini food p","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+KMOkYCgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bravit Professional On the Go Blender Stainless Steel with Multi Function Including Pulse Blend and Go with Two 28oz Cups.  This blender is ultimate cooking companion, with multiple speeds blend up any recipe, both quickly and precisely.  Blender blade is made of powerful stainless steel and designed with cyclonic action.  Super-durable BPA-free pitcher is made of high-performance plastic.  Do you struggle to find the time to make your own healthy and delicious drinks?  Just the Job For whipping up nutritious fruit juices, protein shakes, milk shakes, slushies and smoothies in a flash, the Personal Blender perfectly complements a busy lifestyle. Perfect for the gym, work, travel, college, travel and more. With this compact and versatile blender, you'll always have a tasty drink on hand.  As stylish as it is useful, the Professional On-the-Go Blender features a modern black and stainless steel that will look good in the kitchen and on the go. Powerful 300W motor will make light work of your favorite drink recipe, blending ingredients to perfection in seconds. It comes complete with two 28-ounce BPA-free, easy-grip bottles equipped with spill-proof lids for your convenience. Fits in most car cup holders.  Specifications: Dimensions: 5.5' x 33'  Material ABS Power: 300 W ~ 110-120 V ~ 50/60 Hz  ICE: If you are trying to add ice to your ingredients: For best results and to avoid possible damage to the blades, always add a small amount of liquid to ice before blending. The liquid can be water or one of the liquid ingredients in your recipe. Never pack the sports bottle with ice, only add a few cubes at a time. Allow frozen fruit to thaw slightly before blending to prevent damage to the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+KMOkYCgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRAVIT","source_asin":"B0B5FC8FYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5FC8FYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5FC8FYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
