window.products.push({"id":239567,"name":"Glotoch Stainless Steel French Press Coffee & Tea Maker(8 cup, 34 oz), Glass French Press Coffee & Tea Pot for Coffee/Tea/ Camping/Office (Silver-Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZXgEGnMbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"〖DIMENSIONS〗: Glotoch French Press Coffee Maker & Tea Maker Size:16X10.5X21CM 1000ML . Unique Modern European design that adds luxury to any kitchen.Coffee and Tea Maker 1 Liter (8 coffee cups or 4 coffee mugs) + 2 FILTER screens + 1 Coffee/Tea SCOOP. 〖MATERIAL〗: Every single metal piece is Engineered in food-grade 304 stainless steel giving the coffee press a resilient shine and protecting it from rust. The large carafe is made of thick borosilicate glass that can withstand boiling water! It is also portable and small enough to fit in a travel bag or backpack, making it easy to bring on camping, hiking or backpacking trips, outdoor activities, or to work or the office. 〖3-5 LEVEL FILTRATION SYSTEM〗:We use stainless steel screen filters on a durable plunger supported by a spring loaded base plate to seal the edges, followed by a final top lid strainer to give you a pure brew with no grounds. 2 more pieces of stainless steel screen filters are free for you extraly. You can add to the filtration systerm according to your need. Perfect to make fresh French coffee, tea, espresso or even cold brew. 〖ANTI-HEAT AND SLIP-RESISTANT HANDLE〗: The handle is comfortable and won't slip even with wet hands and it ensures the water kettle won’t fall down or burn your hands. The wonderful constrution make it easy to use and clean. Just simply add water and ground coffee or other stuff to press the drinks you want, extremely easy. And it is rather easy to clean after using, making no trouble. 〖MULTIPURPOSE〗: Glotoch french coffee press, designed to be wonderfully versatile, used for loose leaf tea, Iced tea, espresso beverages, frothed milk, lemonades, hot chocolate, fruit infusions, milk, plant tinctures, rinse quinoa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZXgEGnMbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glotoch Express","source_asin":"B07DJ5PH2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DJ5PH2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DJ5PH2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
