window.products.push({"id":239592,"name":"KEZORY Wall Shelf Double-Piece Set-Wall-Mounted Storage Shelf-with Black Iron Frame and Towel Rack-Floating Decorative Storage for Bathroom, Kitchen, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YGpMmNCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional decorative shelf The simple and chic decorative partitions are perfect for displaying everything from books, small plants, tableware to ceramic spice pots. It can also be used as a pet cat climbing frame, and it also provides a good way to organize and organize your living space. Rustic floating shelves Floating shelves are a great idea to replace wall art with something that is both practical and attractive. Modern rural farmhouse-style shelves will highlight your bedroom, living room, and office by displaying charming exhibits and decorations. Durable Strong and durable, suitable for all kinds of modern interior design, simple installation, can be applied to different walls The clear-textured wooden boards are perfectly combined with unique craftsmanship to create a rustic farmhouse style. tips 1.please align the position and screw the fowel bar fightly first 2.please measure the distance befween the two holes on the wall and mark them 3.before drilling into the wall,you should prepare some tools such as a level ruler or bubble level fo ensure that these holes are in a horizontal line 4.use a drill to punch holes in the walll,put in the anchors,and then put the screws info the anchors.finally mount on the wall.(we suggest you put something on the floor when drilling to protect your floor from getting dirty) Package 2 *floating shelves with metal 1* removabel towe bars 5*short scew 5*long scew 5*plastic anchors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YGpMmNCsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEZORY","source_asin":"B099WBMZ8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099WBMZ8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099WBMZ8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":239593,"name":"Livder Paper Flowers Bright Colorful Tissue Paper Pom Poms for Party Birthday Wedding Christmas Festive Decorations, 15 Pieces of 10, 12, 14 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tfAOhkYRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Liven your event with these colorful paper pom poms. 1, Perfect for any occasion: Birthday, Wedding, Christmas, Kitchen tea, Nursery decorations or any other celebration. 2, Easy-to-assemble, just unfold and fluff the paper flower to create a lively addition to any event. 3, Paper flower decorations are perfect for home/ parties/ reception/ restaurant and various festivals. Very popular room decorations and also use as a photo backdrop. 4, Paper are lightweight, therefore pom poms balls are very easy to hang from ceiling/ window/ tent / curtain rod/ from tree branches/ doorway/ staircases/ tent or use them as table decor. 5, Perfect to mix with other decorations and best for create a romantic atmosphere in weddings.  How to DIY paper flower: 1.For the flat ship,you will have a long strip of tissue paper. Don’t worry,it is so easy. 2.Take the ribbon off and re-tie it in the middle of the paper. Unfold the party ball, fanning out the tissue paper. Ensure the ribbon is centered along the length of paper. 3. After the thread is fixed, Pull on each point of paper at one end of tissue to make them stand up, fluffing each point to the centre of the ball. When all points have been fluffed, this should form half a sphere. 4. Carefully pull the layers of tissue paper apart one by one. The strips of tissue paper are joined together in the finished paper flower. 5. Gently adjust the Pom poms to make it looks full. Once this step is finished you will have a full arty ball and you can hanging this where you like by the ribbon. Specifications Material: Tissue paper Color: yellow, green, rose, blue, orange Quantity: 15PCS Size: 14inch, 12inch, 10inch in diameter Package includes: 5 x 14\" paper pom poms (yellow, green, rose, blue, orange) 5 x 12\" paper pom poms (yellow, green, rose, blue, orange) 5 x 10\" paper pom poms (yellow, green, rose, blue, orange)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tfAOhkYRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Livder","source_asin":"B07J4H1L4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J4H1L4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J4H1L4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
