window.products.push({"id":239674,"name":"12 Inch Impulse Sealer Mylar Bag Sealer Bag Heat Seal, for Cookies Snack Pastry Food Coffee Mushroom Plastic Bag Cellophane Kraft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jy9OZ-txL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Important Tips: bag sealer working ?principle is so easy,so if you have any problem when you use it,kindly pls contact us via 's email. 1.Kindly pls reading Instruction manual carefully and To adjust the temperature that you need when using it for the first time. Higher settings don't necessarily always mean a stronger seal. We recommend starting low and gradually increasing your settings from 2.5-4.5 temperature grade for the different thick bags,it's better don't exceed 5 Grade temperature. 2. When seal is done, the red light will go off. Keep the handle pressed down for 2-3.5 seconds to get seals optimal results.Otherwise the sealing place will be not smooth. 3.Do not use wet cloth to clean the surface of heat sealing strip,after 30 minutes of continuous use, try to let the machine rest about 3 minutes. 4.Level 3.5-4.5 is enough for most applications. 5.Keep the sealer's surface clean to avoid the oxidation of the residue which will reduce the life of the heat sealing strip. Specification: Model:FS-300 Voltage: 110 V / 60 hz Sealing length: 12 inches (300mm) Heat Time: 1.5-3.5 Sec. Impulse power: 180-220W for 12 inch Package Contents: Impulse heat sealer +2 Extra sealing elements + Instruction manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jy9OZ-txL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crafts","source_asin":"B097ZYCWK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097ZYCWK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097ZYCWK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
