window.products.push({"id":239756,"name":"Frame USA Napoleon Series 8x10 Accented Composite Wood Frames (Antique Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DWuJl3eqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Frame USA Napoleon series features an elegant and regal profile that perfectly adorns your family portraits, wedding pictures, artwork, and much more! From its dotted lip to its roping outer design, Napoleon is a classic, antique-inspired frame suited for the home, art gallery, or boardroom. Made from an eco friendly wood based material with rich warm toned metallic finishes for lasting beauty. This series is 2inched wide across the face, and is 1 1/8inches tall to the top of the outer roping design. For ease of display, frames measuring 8x12 or smaller include an easel backing, and frames measuring 9x12 or larger include a saw tooth hanger. For the protective window, frames 11x14 or smaller include glass, while frames 11x16 or larger include styrene to increase durability during shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DWuJl3eqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frame USA","source_asin":"B00EE9OEHI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EE9OEHI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EE9OEHI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
