window.products.push({"id":239856,"name":"Deco 79 Polystone Scroll Handmade Intricate Carved Photo Frame, Set of 2 9\"W, 11\"H (4x6), Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NtPDUUlvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make every moment last a lifetime with our elegant photo frame, place it on a mantle, table or on your dresser and put your memories on display. This item ships in 1 carton. Polystone photo frame makes a great gift for any occasion. Due to the handmade nature of this item, no two will be alike, there will be slight differences in shape, size, and color. Easel stand backing with secure hook for stability; nails and screws are not included. Suitable for indoor use only. Photo frames can hold 1 picture each with 4”x 6” frame opening. This photo frame comes as a set of 2. Traditional style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NtPDUUlvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B0B35HNLSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B35HNLSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B35HNLSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":239857,"name":"Vacwel 14-Pack Variety - Ziplock Vacuum Storage Bags for Clothes - Space Saver Bags for Packing Clothes - Vacuum Space Bags – 4xJumbo (43x30in) +4xLar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VVud-KO9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: 14-Pack Variety - 4x Jumbo (43x30in) + 4x Large (32x21in) +6x Medium (28x20in) + Bonus Hand Pump. Transparent space bags – See at a glance the contents of these heavy duty vacuum storage bags without having to open them. The transparent parts of the bags allow you to easily identify and access the items stored, making it more convenient and faster to find the items you are looking for. MAXIMIZE YOUR STORAGE SPACE with our vacuum bags! Available in jumbo, large and medium sizes, they're perfect for packing away seasonal clothes, blankets, pillows, linens, cushions, duvets, and bedding sets. Say goodbye to cluttered closets and hello to a tidy home with our convenient storage solution. EASY TO USE: With Vacwel's vacuum storage bags, you don't have to worry about your items getting damaged by dust or dampness. These ziplock bags vacuum compress using any standard vacuum cleaner nozzle, and once vacuumed, the compressed plastic bag will lock air out and prevent dust or dampness infiltration. Plus, with the double seal and airtight vacuum valve system, you can rest assured that your items will stay safe and secure, even during long-term storage. QUALITY MADE AND DURABLE: Unlike other vacuum storage bags on the market that tear or lose their suction over time, Vacwel's bags are built to last. Made with an upgraded nylon lining for enhanced durability, these bags are thick yet flexible, striking the perfect balance between strength and flexibility. Plus, the unique colored caps and triple seal valves make it easy to find the bag size you want and ensure quality seal closures every time. GOODWILL: Creating space with Vacwel also creates opportunities! Vacwel gives 5% of sale profits to Sub-Zero, a charity that provide the homeless and disaster-stricken victims of America with essential needs to survive the cold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VVud-KO9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vacwel","source_asin":"B0796JLCH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-239857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0796JLCH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0796JLCH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
